# Appended by `make WITH_JAVA=0`: an image without OpenJDK and the Phase 6
# app runtime, which saves about an hour on a clean build. jrun is still
# installed (it's part of myos-services) but has no JVM to run apps with.
# BR2_PACKAGE_OPENJDK is not set
# BR2_PACKAGE_MYOS_BUS_JAVA is not set
# BR2_PACKAGE_MYOS_JAVA is not set
